# Sensor Manager

## Purpose

Centralized management of all pressure sensors.

## Responsibilities

- Sensor scheduling
- Data collection
- Timestamping
- Validation
- Health monitoring

## Data Flow

Sensors
↓
Sensor Manager
↓
Filters

## Validation Checks

- Communication Status
- Timeout Detection
- Range Check
- Sensor Mismatch Detection
